ulator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, June to July on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Guadalupe County came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025, August to September ran 29% of normal on the middle, and September to October ran 32%. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 185% of normal on the middle. Grid 11828 had its driest year in 1954 at 38% of normal.</p>"}
